      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Paul,\n\nfvp_mini sets this envvar:\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/device/generic/goldfish/+/refs/heads/master/fvp_mini.mk#41\n\nLines 63-66 got removed recently in\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/build/soong/+/1737753/10/java/boot_jars.go\n\nThe error we see it the following:\n\n----------\nFAILED: out/soong/boot-jars-package-check/stamp\nout/soong/host/linux-x86/bin/check_boot_jars out/soong/host/linux-x86/bin/dexdump build/soong/scripts/check_boot_jars/package_allowed_list.txt \u0026\u0026 touch out/soong/boot-jars-package-check/stamp # ...\n\nCheck boot jars.\n\nUsage: check_boot_jars.py \u003cdexdump_path\u003e \u003cpackage_allow_list_file\u003e \u003cjar1\u003e \u003cjar2\u003e ...\n----------\n\nIn short, check_boot_jars.py seems to be invoked with no jar files and so it complains.",
      "parentUuid": "17d29578_2f5ad850",
      "revId": "eb17abfde15024f9d0abbee9c6b85e75e5bad180",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
